---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Estudio Mitre | Excelencia Legal">
  <Navbar />
  
  <main>
    <section id="inicio" class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg-grid"></div>
      <div class="hero-spotlight"></div>

      <div class="container hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge fade-in">
          <span class="badge-line"></span>
          <span class="badge-text">Excelencia Jurídica</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="fade-in delay-1">
          Protegemos lo que <br/>
          <span class="text-gold">Construiste</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="lead fade-in delay-2">
          Estrategia legal de alto impacto para sucesiones complejas, 
          conflictos corporativos y defensa patrimonial.
        </p>
        
        <div class="hero-actions fade-in delay-3">
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary">Reservar Consulta</a>
          <a href="#areas" class="btn-text">
            <span>Explorar Áreas</span>
            <span class="arrow-down">↓</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="areas" class="section-padding areas-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Áreas de Práctica</h2>
          <div class="line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-grid">
          <article class="card large">
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="num">01</span>
              <h3>Sucesiones</h3>
              <p>Planificación hereditaria, testamentos y protección de activos familiares con absoluta discreción.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="link-text">Ver detalles</span>
                <span class="arrow">→</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card tall">
             <div class="card-content">
              <span class="num">02</span>
              <h3>Derecho<br>Laboral</h3>
              <p>Defensa ejecutiva en conflictos corporativos, despidos de alta gerencia y negociaciones sindicales.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="link-text">Ver detalles</span>
                <span class="arrow">→</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
             <div class="card-content">
              <span class="num">03</span>
              <h3>Accidentes</h3>
              <p>Reclamos integrales ART y tránsito. Maximización de indemnizaciones.</p>
              <span class="arrow-corner">↗</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
             <div class="card-content">
              <span class="num">04</span>
              <h3>Contratos</h3>
              <p>Blindaje legal y redacción estratégica para sus negocios.</p>
              <span class="arrow-corner">↗</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process-section section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="process-header">
          <p class="overline">Nuestro Método</p>
          <h2>El camino hacia la<br><span class="text-gold">Resolución</span></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="process-steps">
          <div class="step-item">
            <span class="step-number">01</span>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Diagnóstico de Viabilidad</h3>
              <p>
                No aceptamos casos para perder. Realizamos una auditoría exhaustiva 
                preliminar para determinar las probabilidades reales de éxito.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-item">
            <span class="step-number">02</span>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Ingeniería Legal</h3>
              <p>
                Diseñamos una hoja de ruta a medida. Anticipamos los movimientos de la contraparte 
                y blindamos la posición de nuestro cliente desde el día uno.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-item">
            <span class="step-number">03</span>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Ejecución Ejecutiva</h3>
              <p>
                Ya sea en mediación o litigio, actuamos con celeridad. 
                Nuestra prioridad es cerrar el conflicto en el menor tiempo posible.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-section">
      <div class="container stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number">25+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Años de Trayectoria</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number">500+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Casos Exitosos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number">98%</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Tasa de Resolución</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="estudio" class="section-padding about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-layout">
          <div class="about-text">
            <h2 class="section-title">No somos solo abogados.<br>Somos estrategas.</h2>
            <p>
              En un sistema legal saturado, la diferencia entre ganar y perder reside en la estrategia. 
              En <strong>Estudio Mitre</strong>, combinamos la doctrina clásica con una visión moderna de litigio.
            </p>
            <p>
              Entendemos que detrás de cada expediente hay un patrimonio, una familia o un futuro en juego. 
              Por eso, nuestra firma limita la cantidad de casos activos para garantizar una dedicación absoluta.
            </p>
            
            <div class="signature-block">
              <span class="signature">Estudio Mitre</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="about-visual">
            <div class="image-wrapper">
              <img 
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" 
                alt="Oficinas Estudio Mitre" 
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contacto" class="section-padding contact-section">
      <div class="container contact-layout">
        
        <div class="contact-info">
          <p class="overline">Contacto Directo</p>
          <h2>Su caso requiere<br><span class="text-gold">Atención Inmediata</span></h2>
          <p class="contact-desc">
            Complete el formulario para solicitar una evaluación confidencial. 
            Nuestro equipo revisará su situación y responderá en menos de 24 horas.
          </p>
          
          <div class="contact-details">
            <div class="detail-item">
              <div class="detail-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 15 0Z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-content">
                <span class="detail-label">Nuestras Oficinas</span>
                <p>Av. del Libertador 1000, Piso 5<br>Buenos Aires, CABA</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-item">
              <div class="detail-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 0 1-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 0 0-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 4.5v2.25Z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-content">
                <span class="detail-label">Línea Directa</span>
                <p>+54 11 1234-5678</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-item">
              <div class="detail-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.916V6.75" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-content">
                <span class="detail-label">Consultas Digitales</span>
                <p>contacto@estudiomitre.com</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="luxury-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name">Nombre Completo</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Ej: Juan Pérez" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Correo Electrónico</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="ejemplo@correo.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="phone">Teléfono</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder="+54 11 ..." />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Detalle del Caso</label>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="Describa brevemente su situación..." rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary full-width">
            Enviar Solicitud
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-top">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <div class="logo-text">
            <span>ESTUDIO</span>
            <span class="text-gold">MITRE</span>
          </div>
          <p class="brand-desc">
            Excelencia jurídica y compromiso ético en la defensa de sus intereses patrimoniales y corporativos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-nav">
          <h4>Navegación</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#inicio">Inicio</a></li>
            <li><a href="#areas">Áreas de Práctica</a></li>
            <li><a href="#estudio">El Estudio</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contacto">Solicitar Consulta</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-contact">
          <h4>Oficinas</h4>
          <p>Av. del Libertador 1000, Piso 5<br>CABA, Argentina</p>
          <p class="contact-highlight">consultas@estudiomitre.com</p>
          <p>+54 11 4567-8900</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-divider"></div>

      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Estudio Mitre Abogados.</p>
        <div class="legal-links">
          <a href="#">Política de Privacidad</a>
          <span class="separator">|</span>
          <a href="#">Términos de Uso</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* =========================================
     GLOBAL LAYOUT & HERO
     ========================================= */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg-grid {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; background-size: 50px 50px;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 80%);
    z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-spotlight {
    position: absolute; top: -20%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(80px); z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 100%; max-width: 900px; }

  /* Typography Hero Desktop */
  .hero-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .badge-line { width: 40px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-gold-muted); }
  .badge-text { color: var(--color-gold-muted); font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-weight: 600; }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); 
    color: #fff; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400;
  }
  
  .text-gold { color: var(--color-gold-muted); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-text-gray); max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary { font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 2.5px; padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem; }
  .btn-text { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.8; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
  .btn-text:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--color-gold-muted); }
  .arrow-down { font-size: 1.2rem; }

  .fade-in { opacity: 0; animation: fadeInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards; }
  .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  /* =========================================
     AREAS (Bento Grid)
     ========================================= */
  .section-padding { padding: 6rem 0; }
  .section-header { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .section-header h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #fff; }
  .line { width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--color-gold-muted); }

  .bento-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 280px; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .card { background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--color-navy-card) 0%, rgba(15, 22, 35, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; transition: all 0.4s ease; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.3); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .card-content { padding: 2.5rem; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; z-index: 1; }
  .large { grid-column: span 2; }
  .tall { grid-row: span 2; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; color: #fff; }
  .card p { color: var(--color-text-gray); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .num { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 3rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; right: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .card-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: auto; }
  .link-text { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--color-gold-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .arrow { color: var(--color-gold-muted); font-size: 1.2rem; transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
  .arrow-corner { position: absolute; bottom: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-gold-muted); opacity: 0.5; font-size: 1.2rem; transition: all 0.3s; }
  .card:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(5px); }
  .card:hover .arrow-corner { opacity: 1; transform: translate(2px, -2px); }

  /* =========================================
     PROCESS SECTION
     ========================================= */
  .process-header { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .process-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .step-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 3rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transition: background-color 0.3s ease; }
  .step-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
  .step-item:hover { border-top-color: var(--color-gold-muted); }
  .step-number { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--color-gold-muted); opacity: 0.5; line-height: 1; }
  .step-content h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .step-content p { color: var(--color-text-gray); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 600px; margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }

  /* =========================================
     STATS, ABOUT & CONTACT
     ========================================= */
  .stats-section { border-top: 1px solid rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.1); padding: 4rem 0; background: rgba(8, 12, 19, 0.3); }
  .stats-grid { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; text-align: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2rem; }
  .stat-number { display: block; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 3.5rem; color: var(--color-gold-muted); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--color-text-gray); }

  .about-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
  .section-title { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; }
  .about-text p { color: var(--color-text-gray); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .signature { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--color-gold-muted); font-style: italic; margin-top: 2rem; display: block; opacity: 0.8; }
  
  .about-visual { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .image-wrapper { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .image-wrapper img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; filter: grayscale(20%) contrast(110%) brightness(0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
  .image-wrapper::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 20px; left: -20px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--color-gold-muted); z-index: -1; transition: all 0.5s ease; }
  .about-visual:hover .image-wrapper img { transform: translate(5px, -5px); filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(100%) brightness(1); }
  .about-visual:hover .image-wrapper::after { transform: translate(-5px, 5px); }

  .contact-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: start; }
  .overline { color: var(--color-gold-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .contact-desc { color: var(--color-text-gray); margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-details { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
  .detail-item { display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  .detail-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-gold-muted); }
  .detail-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .detail-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .detail-label { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); font-weight: 600; }
  .detail-content p { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; }

  .luxury-form { background: var(--color-navy-card); padding: 3rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--color-gold-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.8; }
  .luxury-form input, .luxury-form textarea { width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1rem; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem; transition: all 0.3s; outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .luxury-form input::placeholder, .luxury-form textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .luxury-form input:focus, .luxury-form textarea:focus { border-color: var(--color-gold-muted); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .full-width { width: 100%; text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem; }

  /* FOOTER */
  .site-footer { background-color: var(--color-navy-card); border-top: 1px solid rgba(191, 161, 122, 0.2); padding: 5rem 0 2rem 0; margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .footer-brand .logo-text { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .brand-desc { color: var(--color-text-gray); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 350px; }
  .footer-nav h4, .footer-contact h4 { font-family: var(--font-heading); color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .footer-nav ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .footer-nav li { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .footer-nav a, .legal-links a { color: var(--color-text-gray); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
  .footer-nav a:hover, .legal-links a:hover { color: var(--color-gold-muted); }
  .footer-contact p { color: var(--color-text-gray); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .contact-highlight { color: var(--color-gold-muted) !important; }
  .footer-divider { height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .separator { margin: 0 0.5rem; }

  /* =========================================
     RESPONSIVE (MOBILE) STANDARDIZATION
     ========================================= */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    /* 1. LAYOUT CHANGES */
    .hero { text-align: left; padding-bottom: 4rem; padding-top: 3rem; /* Más espacio arriba para el menu */ }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
